
/* ## SECTION-0 - Info and Intro ################## *
 * v3.0.5                  2026-10-20T18-14-32.rics */

/*         cold hands build towers of gold          */

/* - Enable Karaoke - Section 3.                    *
 * - Enable Blur    - Section-3.                    *
 * - Change Previous/Current/Next lyrics' visibility*
 *                  - Section-3.1.                  */

/* Bugs & Suggestions on BetterLyrics Discord       */

/* Credits to chengg, mukeen, drago, boidu, noah,   *
